{"1435800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Racing", "steam_appid": 1435800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Drone Racing! Experience the thrill of FPV aerial competition in Drone Racing, a fully immersive FPV game that puts you in the cockpit of elite racing drones. Fly through amazing arenas and environments in first-person view, where every twist, dive, and turn tests your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for virtual reality, Drone Racing delivers intense, skill-based gameplay with tight controls and realistic flight physics. Compete in a challenging single-player campaign. Earn upgrades, customize your drone’s look and performance, and rise through global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic tracks, responsive handling, and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, Drone Racing offers an unforgettable experience. Master every course, dodge deadly obstacles, and prove you’re the fastest pilot in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras/4e7bc124553d6bcd5b9e468c8b4652e0.avif?t=1772210657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras_big/4e7bc124553d6bcd5b9e468c8b4652e0.avif?t=1772210657 width=1560 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive racing with first-person drone control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time multiplayer (coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several awesome drones to pick from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied tracks with environmental challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in and take flight—Drone Racing is the future of high-speed competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras/975547ce8b0cdaa5f2d49b6496181f04.avif?t=1772210657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras_big/975547ce8b0cdaa5f2d49b6496181f04.avif?t=1772210657 width=1560 height=538 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Drone Racing! Experience the thrill of FPV aerial competition in Drone Racing, a fully immersive FPV game that puts you in the cockpit of elite racing drones. Fly through amazing arenas and environments in first-person view, where every twist, dive, and turn tests your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for virtual reality, Drone Racing delivers intense, skill-based gameplay with tight controls and realistic flight physics. Compete in a challenging single-player campaign. Earn upgrades, customize your drone’s look and performance, and rise through global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic tracks, responsive handling, and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, Drone Racing offers an unforgettable experience. Master every course, dodge deadly obstacles, and prove you’re the fastest pilot in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras/4e7bc124553d6bcd5b9e468c8b4652e0.avif?t=1772210657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras_big/4e7bc124553d6bcd5b9e468c8b4652e0.avif?t=1772210657 width=1560 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive racing with first-person drone control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time multiplayer (coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several awesome drones to pick from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied tracks with environmental challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in and take flight—Drone Racing is the future of high-speed competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras/975547ce8b0cdaa5f2d49b6496181f04.avif?t=1772210657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/extras_big/975547ce8b0cdaa5f2d49b6496181f04.avif?t=1772210657 width=1560 height=538 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Drone Racing is a fast-paced FPV game where you pilot high-speed drones through futuristic tracks. Compete in single-player or multiplayer modes, master challenging environments, and climb global leaderboards for the ultimate immersive aerial action experience.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/67f5c8b124a8d70fd057db07fa8708e8e482fcf5/header.jpg?t=1772210657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/a98f84827b0bed8f39cadfbee53ca0765fa67d91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772210657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435800/a98f84827b0bed8f39cadfbee53ca0765fa67d91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772210657", "website": "https://slumberlion.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system OS: Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><st